message: "If you use this release candidate, cite the software and the exact artifact manifest."
title: "Partizan: exact short-game and constrained-chess research suite"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nicholson
    given-names: Devin
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/devinnicholson/partizan"
url: "https://github.com/devinnicholson/partizan"
abstract: >-
  An experimental suite for bounded exact comparison, semantic canonicalization,
  proof-carrying combinatorial-game records, and structural decomposition in
  constrained chess positions. The v0.1 scope covers finite normal-play short
  games, exact bounded-domain records, and replayable provenance. Learned
  benefit, agency, chess temperature, and model-guided discovery remain
  research questions.
